# Normalise everything to LF in the repo and in the working tree.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic: the code generators write LF, and the
# `contracts-check` gate compares regenerated output against the checked-out file.
# If git rewrote those files to CRLF on checkout, every run would report a spurious
# diff and the gate would be permanently red.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures - never touch these.
*.nc     binary
*.parquet binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.woff2  binary
